---

# Mermaid：Flowchart / Graph

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    User[用户] --> CLI[tt slide]
    CLI --> Server[本地 HTTP 服务]
    Server --> Parser[解析 .slide]
    Parser --> Renderer[Reveal 页面]
    Renderer --> Browser[浏览器演示]
```

---

# Mermaid：Sequence Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Speaker as 演示者
    participant CLI as tt slide
    participant UI as Slide UI
    participant FS as 工作区文件

    Speaker->>CLI: tt slide slides/tt-slide-showcase.slide
    CLI->>UI: 提供前端和 deck API
    UI->>FS: 请求 slide / assets
    FS-->>UI: 返回内容
    UI-->>Speaker: 播放演示
```

---

# Mermaid：Class Diagram

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class SlideData {
      +int index
      +SlidePart[] parts
      +SlideLayout layout
      +string class
    }
    class SlidePart {
      +markdown
      +mermaid
      +d2
    }
    class TemplateConfig {
      +string name
      +string revealTheme
      +defaults
    }
    SlideData --> SlidePart
    SlideData --> TemplateConfig
```

---

# Mermaid：State Diagram

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Editing
    Editing --> Saved: write .slide
    Saved --> Serving: tt slide
    Serving --> Presenting: open browser
    Presenting --> Editing: live reload
    Presenting --> [*]: end
```

---

# Mermaid：Entity Relationship

```mermaid
erDiagram
    DECK ||--o{ SLIDE : contains
    SLIDE ||--o{ PART : contains
    TEMPLATE ||--o{ RENDERED_SLIDE : styles
    SLIDE ||--o{ RENDERED_SLIDE : becomes

    DECK {
      string title
      string transition
    }
    SLIDE {
      int index
      string layout
    }
    PART {
      string type
      string role
    }
```

---

